    "business_requirements": [
      "Requirement 1",
      "Requirement 2",
      "Requirement 3",
      "Requirement 4",
      "Requirement 5"
    ]
  }
}
Only include 5 to 7 meaningful requirements that reflect actual user flows or business logic.
Return only the final JSON output, with no explanation or markdown.

